  "details": "# Issue: \n\nRight now the Avatar Touch Haptics are in the Accessibility Category of the Main Menu Settings Tab. This is a bit of a weird place for them in my option as I don't see how they are related to Accessibility at all.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nMove them to the Avatars Category right below the Avatar Interaction Settings. These two basically belong to each other as Avatar Haptics require Avatar Interaction to be enabled and they would make a lot more sense in there compared to the Accessibility Category.",
